[list]
 [*] Fixed [b]Oculus CV1[/b] Support;
 [*] Added full  [b]Xbox Controller[/b] support;
 [*] Fixed [b]KANT Controls[/b] (SteamVR) for both Left Hand and Right Hand;
 [*] [b]Flat Screen[/b] support added;
 [*] [b]Keyboard&Mouse[/b] controls  as well as [b]Steering wheel[/b] (test mode) support added; 
 [*] Crushing and some other minor bugs fixed. 
[/list]
Thanks to all for your interest and patience, we are continuing working on improvements.

